        {
          "tag": "em",
          "children": ["How long will the elevator last?"]
        },
        " Understanding elevator lifespan is important because it directly affects safety, maintenance costs, and long-term performance. Choosing the right system and maintaining it properly can make a huge difference in how efficiently your elevator operates over the years. In a competitive market with many ",
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "attributes": {
